Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:51:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: swap CBlockHeader and block index to 134-byte V2 header
 and BLAKE3 BlockId

Swaps CBlockHeader, CBlockIndex, CDiskBlockIndex, CompressedHeader
(headerssync), net_processing, txdb, and blockchain RPCs to the 134-byte
Lotus V2 header layout and BLAKE3 BlockId.
